<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s326S">According to the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w17">claim</span> of certain <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w1">other</span> groups, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w5">deeds</span> which bring one an <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w3">experience</span> in the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w2">hells</span> are to be understood as the &quot;<span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w6">black</span>&quot; ones. <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s326p1">And</span> those that bring one an <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w10">experience</span> in some <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w9">other</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w8">birth</span> in the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w7">desire realm</span> are to be <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w35">understood</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s326p2">as</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w15">two</span>: as <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w16">deeds</span> that are both <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w12"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s326w13">white</span> and <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s326w14">black</span></span>. <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s326w18">Still</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w20">other</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w19">groups</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w34">assert</span> that those kinds of <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w23">deeds</span> which the path of <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w21">seeing</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w22">eliminates</span> are the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w24">black</span> ones, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s326p3">while</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w28">other</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w33">deeds</span> that <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w27">come</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s326w26">from</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w25">desire</span> are <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w32">both</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s326w29"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s326w30">white</span> and <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s326w31">black</span></span>. We turn next to our fifth group of deeds, which includes those divided on the basis of the person who possesses them. ********* 72 Three Types of Each Path of Action</span>
</div>
