<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, reconciled from two independent proposals. myong owns each experience; the causative recast bring one an is left unbanked rather than assigning bring to the future auxiliary alone. rig and su are paired once in the second, explicit two-color classification; the earlier repetition is unwrapped. Each other, deed and color belongs to its own clause. gngsde pa remains unbanked and a LOW/PROBABLE human-review source question. The transition and heading remain intact. No source or hgm_gloss is changed.</div>
